# Without the Lookup right, commands answer as if the mailbox did not exist (RFC 4314 section 4)
C: a1 DELETE #user.boby.mailbox-none
S: a1 NO DELETE failed. No such mailbox.

C: a2 DELETE #user.boby.mailbox-nonexisting
S: a2 NO DELETE failed. No such mailbox.

C: a3 GETMETADATA #user.boby.mailbox-none /private/comment
S: a3 NO \[TRYCREATE\] GETMETADATA failed. No such mailbox.

C: a4 GETMETADATA #user.boby.mailbox-nonexisting /private/comment
S: a4 NO \[TRYCREATE\] GETMETADATA failed. No such mailbox.

C: a5 SETMETADATA #user.boby.mailbox-none (/private/comment "x")
S: a5 NO \[TRYCREATE\] SETMETADATA failed. No such mailbox.

C: a6 SETMETADATA #user.boby.mailbox-nonexisting (/private/comment "x")
S: a6 NO \[TRYCREATE\] SETMETADATA failed. No such mailbox.

C: a7 SELECT INBOX
S: \* OK \[MAILBOXID \(.*\)\] Ok
S: \* FLAGS \(.*\)
S: \* .* EXISTS
S: \* .* RECENT
S: \* OK \[UIDVALIDITY .*\] UIDs valid
S: \* OK \[UNSEEN 1\] MailboxMessage 1 is first unseen
S: \* OK \[PERMANENTFLAGS \(.*\)\] Limited
S: \* OK \[HIGHESTMODSEQ .*\] Highest
S: \* OK \[UIDNEXT .*\] Predicted next UID
S: a7 OK \[READ-WRITE\] SELECT completed.

C: a8 COPY 1 #user.boby.mailbox-none
S: a8 NO \[TRYCREATE\] COPY failed. No such mailbox.

C: a9 COPY 1 #user.boby.mailbox-nonexisting
S: a9 NO \[TRYCREATE\] COPY failed. No such mailbox.

C: a10 MOVE 1 #user.boby.mailbox-none
S: a10 NO \[TRYCREATE\] MOVE failed. No such mailbox.
